PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Graph Structure
    - Nodes v0, v1, v2, v3
    - Edges between v0→v1→v2
  L2: Collapse Surface Highlight
    - Node v3 marked in red (#FF0000FF)
    - No outgoing edges from v3
    - Dashed boundary around v3 (6px red dashed)
  L3: Labels
    - "Collapse Surface C"
    - "Undefined δ(v3, a)"
  L4: Annotation Overlay
    - Arrow pointing to v3 labeled "dead zone"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
